============================================================================================


JUMPBOX - this host provides secure access to various HPC clusters
          note jumpbox is accessible from anywhere on the Internet.

The login nodes of the clusters that you can ssh to are as follows:

  - cluster name OS          - login node name - Purpose
  - kunanyi OHPC Centos 7.4  -  kunanyi        - General purpose
  - Rosalind OHPC Centos 7.7 -  rosalind       - Genomics


If you need access to X11 based applications then remember to add -X or -Y to your ssh command.
ssh -Y is a good choice if using Matlab with the graphical user interface.

It is recommended you use 'screen' on the login node of the cluster to preserve your session
as this jumpbox will automatically reboot for security update patches.
This will happen on a regular basis.

